# MaxMind GeoLite2 baseline DBs (GeoLite2-ASN.mmdb,
# GeoLite2-Country.mmdb) are committed at the repo root so clones
# work out of the box with no extra setup. They're licensed under
# MaxMind's GeoLite2 terms — refresh roughly every 30 days.
#
# Anything else (extra .mmdb files, downloaded tarballs, extracted
# GeoLite2-*/ folders from `make geoip-link`) stays untracked.

# *.mmdb
# !GeoLite2-ASN.mmdb
# !GeoLite2-Country.mmdb
# *.tar.gz
# GeoLite2-*/
